Compile the llama.cpp server sources wllama's hand-maintained list is missing.

The Stage 0 bump to llama.cpp d7d1b632d split the server code into files
wllama @d275dac does not compile, so the wasm link failed with undefined
symbols: server_slot_sched, server_prompt_cache and server_prompt::get_reuse
moved to tools/server/server-slot-sched.cpp, and server_realtime_slot to
tools/server/server-realtime.cpp. cpp-httplib is also a compiled library in
this llama.cpp version and server-common.cpp calls httplib::hosted_at, so
add vendor/cpp-httplib/httplib.cpp as well.

common/fit.cpp stays excluded on purpose: wllama replaces common_fit_params
with its own stub in cpp/wllama-context.h (see patch 0012).

